PROJECT TITLE
AI FITNESS PLAN

1. PROJECT GOAL

To develop a simple AI-based fitness planning system that provides personalized fitness recommendations according to the user's goals and requirements.

2. PROJECT PHASES

Phase 1 – Brainstorming & Ideation
• Identify the problem.
• Generate the project idea.
• Define the target users.

Phase 2 – Requirements Analysis
• Identify functional requirements.
• Identify software and hardware requirements.
• Define user inputs and expected outputs.

Phase 3 – Project Design
• Design the system flow.
• Define inputs, processing and outputs.
• Plan the user interface.

Phase 4 – Project Development
• Develop the fitness planning system.
• Implement the recommendation logic.
• Connect user input with the fitness plan generation.

Phase 5 – Testing
• Test different user inputs.
• Check whether suitable recommendations are generated.
• Identify and fix errors.

Phase 6 – Documentation
• Prepare the project documentation.
• Add screenshots and project details.
• Organize the project files.

Phase 7 – Demonstration
• Demonstrate the working project.
• Explain the input, processing and output.
• Record the project demonstration with voice explanation.

3. PROJECT TIMELINE

Week 1 – Ideation and Requirements
Week 2 – Design and Planning
Week 3 – Development
Week 4 – Testing
Week 5 – Documentation and Demonstration

4. EXPECTED DELIVERABLES

• Project files
• Working project
• Testing results
• Project documentation
• Demonstration video
• Presentation

5. PROJECT OUTCOME

A simple and functional AI Fitness Plan system that provides personalized fitness recommendations based on user requirements.
